# RFC 9728 well-known locations for the ops MCP resource (/api/ops/mcp).
# The API itself is served by the Worker; these paths would otherwise fall to
# the SPA and return HTML, which makes MCP connector platforms give up before OAuth.
/.well-known/oauth-protected-resource/api/ops/mcp  /oauth-protected-resource.json  200
/.well-known/oauth-protected-resource  /oauth-protected-resource.json  200
